          "distinct": true,
          "id": "dcd5d6c57ab8e84f53a59f0af93e33e4bd9dbb14",
          "message": "feat(importer): matcher proposes AoN mappings from listings (#1206)\n\n* feat(importer): matcher proposes AoN mappings from listings\n\nproposeAonMappings matches an entry to the one same-named, same-kind\nrow in its book listing and reports two candidates instead of\nguessing. content:aon-propose merges proposals into\ncontent/enrichment/<pack>.json without touching existing mappings.\nAonListingFile moves to the sdk so the fetcher and matcher share it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(content): proposed AoN URLs for Player Core\n\nOutput of content:aon-propose: 1657 entries mapped, 0 ambiguous,\n610 unmatched (names AoN lists differently or entries it has no row\nfor). Pages are still to come from the book.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(importer): brand the AoN listing strings\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(importer): match creatures, rules and relics to AoN pages\n\nMonsters and NPCs list creatures, Rules lists variant rules and\nRelics lists equipment, so the Monster Core and NPC Core listings\nmatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(content): AoN listings for the other 45 books\n\nFetched with just aon-sources: robots.txt (404), one request every 2s,\nSources pages only. Player Core re-fetched; its ETag changed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(content): proposed AoN URLs for every pack\n\nOutput of content:aon-propose over all 46 listings: 11668 entries mapped.\nAmbiguous entries and pages are left for review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
