          "id": "ac32342b98c60a17ff371cff7b2e38914aecda48",
          "message": "fix(sheet): widen waitFor timeouts in form limits spec (#1334)\n\nThe spellcasting waits used vitest's one second default, and the\ninert-form test read the actions section before it had rendered.\nBoth failed intermittently on a loaded runner.\n\nCloses #1252\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
