          "id": "ec9ddede7d619025f101e3d19ee4e6210ccea3fc",
          "message": "feat(character): theme the generator on a weapon base (#1404)\n\nThe generate dialog could name only a weapon category and group. Add a\nweapon base select (longsword, shortbow) listing the bases the official\ncontent holds. Choosing a base sets the category and group its weapons\nshare; changing either of those clears the base. The request carries the\nbase, which the domain already honours.\n\nPart of #1115\nCloses #1377\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
