          "id": "130ca5c7fdb37f528d3c7f005645d00d161891f5",
          "message": "fix(importer): keep ChoiceSets whose pick reader fails to parse (#1623)\n\nA ChoiceSet whose pick is read by an element that stays in the backlog now\nstays there with it, along with the grants and selectors that follow the pick,\nso the player is never asked a question that changes nothing. Re-imports the\naffected packs: ChoiceSet gaps rise from 640 to 736 as those picks move back.\n\nCloses #1602\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-31T23:01:55+10:00",
          "tree_id": "bbadc1aa0c5f83eb979be43e38a3565874ab5b78",
