          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d9b4f30c2bce80e60f5666d5055ebf99405df1da",
          "message": "fix(grants): offer a ChoiceSet option that gates on a skill rank (#1688)\n\nA ChoiceSet is offered before the character's skill ranks are worked out,\nand the core rules list skill as a known namespace, so skill:arcana:rank:0\nread false for every option and the Skill Training, Natural Skill, Skill\nMastery and Rogue Dedication pickers came up empty. Choice offers now read\na missing skill rank as unknown, so the option is offered with when it holds.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-01T09:26:19+10:00",
          "tree_id": "23eeccbbfcd5e5e54c71f5f0df80d41214a01d77",
