          "message": "feat(rules): engine applies AdjustStrike to Strikes (#1710)\n\n* feat(rules): engine applies AdjustStrike to Strikes\n\nAn equipped weapon's Strike now changes under the AdjustStrike\nelements in play: traits added or removed, materials and property\nrunes added, and range increment under every numeric mode. An\nelement reaches a weapon when its predicate holds and `strikes`\nholds over the weapon's own roll options, including item:picked.\n\nWeapons gain the roll options category, group, base, melee, ranged,\nthrown and magical beside their type, slug and traits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(rules): unarmed and deity-favored AdjustStrike reads\n\nWeapons gain the roll options `unarmed` (category unarmed) and\n`deity-favored` (base weapon favoured by the deity), which committed\nAdjustStrike rules read in `strikes`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
